OL,3,GNEWSAMan fosters 13 children after two
OL,4,Atransplants
OL,5,
OL,6,FA foster carer who had two kidney
OL,7,Ftransplants said he hopes to show the
OL,8,Fchildren in his care that "you can do
OL,9,Fanything".
OL,11,FThomas, 31, a former hairdresser from
OL,12,FCleveleys in Lancashire, started
OL,13,Ffostering with his partner Wayne, 56,
OL,14,Fjust months after his second
OL,15,Ftransplant. The couple have now
OL,16,Ffostered 13 children.
OL,18,FThomas, who was diagnosed with chronic
OL,19,Fkidney disease as a teenager, had his
OL,20,Ffirst transplant at 23.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
