OL,3,GNEWSAMan fosters 13 children after two
OL,4,Atransplants
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said becoming a foster parent was
OL,7,Fthe best thing he has ever done and
OL,8,Fadded: "I hope that the children we
OL,9,Fhave helped look after look at us and
OL,10,Fsee that if you try, you can do
OL,11,Fanything."
